<theodulf. carm. 61.1>	Qui Romam Roma, Turonum Turonove catervas
<theodulf. carm. 61.2>	Ire, redire cupis cernere scande, vide.
<theodulf. carm. 61.3>	Hinc sata spectabis, vites et claustra ferarum,
<theodulf. carm. 61.4>	Flumina, prata, vias, pomiferumque nemus.
<theodulf. carm. 61.5>	Haec dum conspicies, dum plurima grata videbis,
<theodulf. carm. 61.6>	Auctoris horum sis memor ipse dei.
